  <h2>Optional: put your website online</h2>
  <p class="lede">
    Ready to share a link? Follow <a href="/publish/index.html"
      >Put your website online</a
    >
    to publish the checked HTML/CSS site using Cloudflare Pages' free browser upload.
    No Git, extra software or domain purchase is needed.
  </p>
  <p>
    This is a separate decision to make your photos and words public. The
    follow-up explains why I chose it over Vercel and Netlify for this exercise,
    which files to upload, how to check the live page, and how to update or undo
    a deployment. Upload only a prepared public-files folder, never your whole
    working project or backup. It also covers
    <a href="/publish/index.html#technology"
      >Astro and choosing technology for larger sites</a
    >
    and <a href="/publish/index.html#migrate">moving an existing portfolio</a>.
    AWS S3 and CloudFront can wait for a later guide.
  </p>
